@base = http://localhost:4010/v1
@token = mock-token-usr_001

### Saúde do mock
GET {{base}}/health

### Login da conta demo
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lia@ciclo.app",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Lista
GET {{base}}/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar caminhada como feita
PATCH {{base}}/habits/hab_002/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "completedAt": "2026-10-30T21:15:00-03:00"
}

### Criar hábito
POST {{base}}/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Meditar 5 min",
  "frequency": "Todos os dias",
  "icon": "meditate",
  "color": "terracotta",
  "description": "Só sentar."
}
